WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:05.290
They said... that she passed quietly, as if she'd fallen asleep...

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.010
Got a cold?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.260
Well, a little. But I should be hunky-dory by tomorrow!

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.970
Kasuga... looks like I won't ever be crying again.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.090
I've shed a lifetime's worth of tears!

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.100
Maybe it's because Hikaru was around... that I fell for you, Kasuga...

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.870
This isn't true!

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.810
Hikaru... I couldn't do anything for you...

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.030
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.920
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.060
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:34.830
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:37.800
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.940
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.810
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.780
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.950
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.890
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:25.720
Hikaru Passes Away;
And Then There Were None.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.740
Sempai! Yippee!

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:35.600
Here you go.
It's your turn today, Sempai!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.570
"Exchange Diary of Love"

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.470
You're that excited?

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.450
Huh? W...Well, you know...

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.910
Oh! Passionate, I see... You guys!

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.820
"As she handed it over to me, suddenly..."

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.370
"...I was a bit abashed or so I felt..."

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.130
That... is what should be
written in the diary!

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.020
G...Guys, knock it off!

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:59.770
Sempai and I are in a 100% pure boy-girl relationship!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.290
So, please don't bother us!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.000
Hikaru...

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:09.710
Well... I can't wait to read what you write...
words that burst with love!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.170
Bye!

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.210
A...Ayukawa!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.010
An exchange-diary?

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:19.110
Huh?! Yeah...
An exchange-diary?

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:19.180
Passionate, aren't you.
Huh?! Yeah...

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.250
Passionate, aren't you.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.240
What the...
Passionate, aren't you.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.730
I only started doing this
because Hikaru insisted...

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.690
What do you want, Yuusaku?!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.000
About that exchange-diary that you're...

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.030
...swapping back and forth with Kasuga...

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.200
The "Exchange-Diary of Love!"

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.260
W...Well, that's what I mean!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.680
If you could let me take part in it...

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.440
...so that we'll have a group-diary...

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.700
Be serious! Yuusaku, you should just...

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.680
...make yourself a picture-diary with your crayons!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.740
Hikaru!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:59.920
"Today, once more, Hikaru hates me!"

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:06.770
Let's see...

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:12.040
"Today, I took a bath together with Kumagoro, my stuffed bear!"

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:15.340
"Kumagoro is okay even when he gets wet!"

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.750
"Sempai, don't you think he's adorable?"

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.800
Gee... What's the big deal?!

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:28.320
"Kumagoro... is...

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:34.950
"...a very... good bear."

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.400
"When I...

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:46.440
"...take... my bath...

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:54.780
"...please... let me... borrow him."

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.810
There!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.010
Oh? A new menu?

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.860
Yup. Master asked me to come up with one.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.720
So I'll... make you a little of this and that,
tomorrow at my house.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.420
At your house?

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.890
Based on your reactions,
I'll decide what goes on the new menu.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.870
Sounds good! Lucky!

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.840
Ayukawa's home-cooking, eh?

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.770
Oh, I know! Sempai...

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:24.290
Let's read our Exchange-Diary of Love to her,
in thanks for tomorrow's food!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.980
Well? "Good idea," yes?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.780
N...No, that's... er...

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:33.840
Madoka would be so touched by our story of true love!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.510
W...What I mean is that... Hikaru...

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.960
Got a cold?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:48.820
Well, a little. But I should be hunky-dory by tomorrow!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.650
Hunky-dory, eh?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.910
I wonder if Hikaru's cold could get bad enough...

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.710
...that she'd have to stay home.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.740
That way...

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.490
...I wouldn't have to read
the exchange-diary either...

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:12.110
I hope she gets a fever and stays home!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.220
Don't you think so too, Jingoro?

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:18.630
Did you hear that?!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.750
Yeah! That's just too awful!
Did you hear that?!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:26.030
I can't believe you, Oniichan!
You're so conceited!

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:36.410
I'm not feeling good today...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.340
Good morning.

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.090
Kasuga! Where have you been?!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.130
Did something happen, Komatsu?

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.670
There you go again! You stupid pretender!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.140
Today is Hikaru's funeral, remember?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.560
Hikaru's?!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.720
Damn right!
Hikaru's?!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.630
Oh, c'mon!
Damn right!

00:06:58.630 --> 00:06:58.670
Oh, c'mon!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.760
Stop kidding me like that! That's awful!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:03.730
You idiot! How could I joke about something like that?!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:10.150
They said... that she passed quietly, as if she'd fallen asleep.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.450
It's such a shock, ain't it.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.620
She was so full of energy.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.210
Now, wait a sec!

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.260
Offed by a cold!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.320
"By a cold?!"

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.730
H...Hikaru!

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.330
This isn't happening!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.700
If we don't get going soon...
we'll be late for the memorial service.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.180
L... Look at all these people...

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.290
Today was declared a
National Day of Mourning...

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:52.220
...so apparently, all the schools and businesses in Japan are closed.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.060
"A National Day of Mourning?!" You're kidding me, right?

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.120
Why, you! That's an awful thing
to say about Hikaru!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.090
It's Hikaru, after all...
She deserves her Day!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.540
Say, what happened to Hikaru-oneechan?

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.980
You see, Hikaru...

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.520
...has left on a journey,
to a world far, far away.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.920
She won't be coming back ever again!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.450
Dad...

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:19.890
Kyosuke... compose yourself, and be strong, understand?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.340
Yeah.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:31.500
God can be... cruel.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:36.170
Taking the life of Hikaru,
an innocent girl with the soul of an angel.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.230
Master...

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.810
H...Hikaru... you really are gone, aren't you?

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.840
A...Ayukawa...

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:50.780
Er...

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:51.570
Not now.
Er...

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:52.130
Huh?
Not now.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:52.210
Huh?

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.280
I don't want to talk to anybody right now.

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.830
Ayukawa's tears...

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:04.820
...her tears... stabbed at my heart.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.420
"Hikaru is my life"

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.880
Y...Yuusaku!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.310
And now, representing
the friends of the deceased...

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:20.150
...let us welcome an
exceptionally close friend of hers...

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.810
...Kasuga Kyosuke... with his eulogy, in remembrance of her.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.340
What?! Me?!

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:27.280
Kasuga!

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:29.910
Pull yourself together, man!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.700
H...Hikaru...

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:43.560
Just remembering your
dazzling smile makes me...

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.740
Hikaru...

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:49.480
H...Hikaru... I can't...

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:52.210
No... I can't do the eulogy!

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.240
Kasuga, you idiot! Stop crying!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:59.530
For Hikaru's sake, you've got to...
pronounce the eulogy!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.690
Pull yourself together, man!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:03.330
Yuusaku...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.990
You shouldn't be crying! You can't cry!

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:09.060
Would Hikaru be happy if she saw you crying?!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.490
Don't cry!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:25.940
Hikaru!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:28.240
Hikaru!
Hikaru!

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:31.210
Hikaru!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.180
Hikaru!

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.250
And now, for the final farewell...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:26.650
Hikaru... It's better if you take Kumagoro with you...

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.710
Hikaru!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:36.080
All those jokes... of ours,
as stupid and lame as they were...

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.170
...only Hikaru always laughed about them.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:42.910
The best times of our youth... have come to an end...

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.090
...along with Hikaru.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:49.520
We've made up our minds...
to put our hearts and souls into our studies!

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:53.200
Including Hikaru's share, as she...

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.140
...can't study anymore,
even if she wanted to!

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.740
If we don't at least do that much...

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:59.840
...she'll ridicule us from above, as a star up in the heavens!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:12:59.930
"Juku:" supplementary "cram" school.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:02.490
We've gotta go look for a juku!
"Juku:" supplementary "cram" school.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:02.570
"Juku:" supplementary "cram" school.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.690
Farewell... to our youth!

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.290
To America?!

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:20.040
Yeah... First thing in the morning.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:20.150
W...Why?!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.620
'Cause...
W...Why?!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:21.660
W...Why?!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.750
...everything here reminds me of Hikaru.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:28.450
Besides... A Japan without Hikaru...?!

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.530
N...No!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.870
Kasuga... thank you for always treating Hikaru so kindly.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.700
A...Ayukawa... W...What about
our friendship?!

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:40.100
It's over, you see.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:44.990
Maybe I fell for you, Kasuga... because Hikaru was around.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.220
Ayukawa...

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:50.710
Madoka! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:56.000
For you, Kasuga... Hikaru could
stop associating with delinquents, but...

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.130
...this is just... this is just...

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.530
...too awful!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.590
A...Ayukawa!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.810
Ayukawa!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:13.240
I don't care about anything anymore!
Kasuga, farewell!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.920
Ayukawa!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.470
D...Dad, what are you doing?!

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.900
Kyosuke... I'm quitting
being a photographer!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.740
W...Why?!

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.710
Because... Hikaru's gone...

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.940
Dad!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.670
I shouldn't be shooting pictures anymore!

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:45.870
What?!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.000
Oniichan...

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.970
Kurumi! Manami! What're you guys d...

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:53.620
We've decided to devote ourselves to Buddhism.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:58.160
Hikaru's death... confirmed that "beauty is short-lived," right?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.820
And, who knows when
it'll be our time to go?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:05.080
We'll be praying to Hikaru's spirit
as long as we live...

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:21.300
M...Master!

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:25.860
A...ABCB... W...Why?!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.920
Since nobody will be
coming here from now on...

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.990
...I thought that I should just tear down the joint.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.960
B...But... there's no need to demolish it!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.160
Wrong!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.280
In a situation like this, it's better to just get it over with... like this!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:45.100
It was always fun to see you guys
having a great time...

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:47.580
...and there won't be... any more of that.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.800
Yuusaku!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:53.450
Kasuga... looks like I won't ever be crying again.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:57.420
I've shed a lifetime's worth of tears!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:00.290
I've decided to go on a pilgrimage.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.820
That's what I'm doing for Hikaru.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.990
Guess I'll see you around.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:08.050
Everybody's going... separate ways...

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:22.640
I see... I see it now, Hikaru...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:26.360
The one who kept us together
all this time... was you, Hikaru!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.070
And, I... didn't have a clue.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.290
A time... A time just like this is exactly...

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:39.480
...when I'd hope for a cheery, simple,
and naïve soul like Hikaru.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.860
Yahoo!

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.000
Did'ja wait?

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:51.470
Oh, what's wrong? You look as if the world has come to an end!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:55.880
A very fine girl named Hikaru... suddenly passed away.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.350
Well, she's human, after all!
Death is inevitable, you know!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.350
C'mon, everybody! Cheer up!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.320
C'mon! C'mon! Beeble Burble Booble!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.720
Don't worry! Don't worry about such things.

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:10.550
There's a bright future, that's like "Yippee,"
in store for all of you!

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:13.250
Chin up! Chin up!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:20.150
That's our Hikaru!
Being dead doesn't bother you at all!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:28.510
"Today, I took a bath together with Kumagoro, my stuffed bear."

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:33.230
"Kumagoro is perfectly okay, even if he gets wet, Sempai."

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.450
So admirable!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.350
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry, Hikaru...

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:44.590
If... If only I hadn't wished for your cold to get worse!

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.620
I just can't imagine a world without you, Hikaru!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:54.780
I'll use the Power... something...
to make Hikaru come alive again!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.300
To deal with things like this... is why I have the Power!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.900
Hikaru! Come to life again!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:23.990
I know!

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.030
If I time-slip back to when Hikaru was still alive...

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:40.740
Why isn't it working?!

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:54.230
Hikaru...

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.650
I couldn't do anything to save you!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.030
W...Who're you?!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:14.830
That is of no consequence...
You want her to be alive again, right?

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.590
You can bring her back to life, sir?!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:19.750
W...Well, yeah...

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:21.540
I beg you, please! I beg you, please!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.990
I'm willing to do anything... if you can bring her back!

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:27.730
If you tell me to chew peanuts with my eyes, I'll do it!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.450
So... So, please! Please!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.420
You've got to bring Hikaru back from the dead!

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:36.670
Fine. Then I must test your courage.

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.340
Before the end of the Seventh Day
after her death...

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:40.870
...you must dig a tunnel through that mountain!

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:44.890
If you do, the girl may be restored to life!

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:47.680
Hikaru...

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:57.680
Hikaru... Hikaru...

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:11.490
Hikaru!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.840
Ushiko!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.040
Umao!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:18.610
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.650
And, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.880
Hikaru... Hikaru...

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.220
Hikaru...

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.470
Hikaru... Hikaru...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:33.410
Darling...?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.190
I... can't live without you!

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:44.660
Hikaru!

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.200
Hikaru!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:58.000
So bright!

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.480
So, how was it? How did it feel
to endure a Full-Course Nightmare?

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.910
"N...Nightmare?!" Oh!

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:15.370
Well? A realistic performance, wouldn't you say?

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.970
G...Grandpa! Y...You rat!

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:22.740
Oniichan, you wished for Hikaru to be gone, didn't you?!

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:26.130
We thought that was totally rotten, so we asked Grandpa to help out!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.380
Well?! Do you give up now?!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.740
Hikaru!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.720
Listen! Do you know where Hikaru is?

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.790
I can't find her anywhere!

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:41.180
What's with you? Why such a serious look?

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:43.110
Oh! E...Er...

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.630
If you're looking for Hikaru,
she was talking to Yuu a little while ago.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:47.200
What?!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.310
She said something like,
"I've finally decided to say good-bye..."

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.340
What?!

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:53.270
She seemed rather serious.

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:55.000
N...No way...

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.800
She said that they'll be holding a parting ceremony together.

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:01.580
N...No way! I've got to stop her!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:04.280
Kasuga! Will it really be a problem if she leaves you behind?

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:06.000
What? Yeah...

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:09.520
I... I've long waited for this day!

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:11.950
Honesty will always prevail!

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:14.690
The truth is that,
it's really hard for me to do this.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.220
Come on now!
Please go ahead and tell me!

00:22:18.320 --> 00:22:22.360
I've finally decided to bid farewell to my childhood memories.

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:25.010
I wasn't sure if I was making the right decision though.

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:28.670
Childhood memories?! I thought you were gonna dump that rat Kasuga!

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:30.740
Say what?!

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:34.780
C'mon! Set them afloat for me,
any way you want to!

00:22:34.780 --> 00:22:37.920
Good-bye! Oh, my childhood memories...

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:39.970
...thank you for all you've
done for me all these years!

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:43.860
Hikaru!

00:22:43.860 --> 00:22:46.940
Sempai! You've come to see him go?

00:22:47.320 --> 00:22:49.830
Kumagoro, the stuffed animal?!

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:51.360
'Cause, Sempai...

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:53.960
You wrote it in our diary...

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:56.940
...that I act like a little girl, so...

00:22:56.940 --> 00:23:01.090
It's okay! It's okay! That's the
kind of thing that I like about you, so...

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:03.560
Yippee! I'm happy!

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:09.510
Yuusaku, go get my Kumagoro right this instant!

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:10.520
What?!

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:13.540
You were the one who let him go,
weren't you?

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:15.480
B... But...

00:23:15.480 --> 00:23:17.510
Hurry! Hurry!

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:19.950
Geez! Fine, I'll go!

00:23:23.820 --> 00:23:28.820
Nothing beats...
seeing Hikaru smile, after all...

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:35.270
I'm not sure why, but...

00:23:35.270 --> 00:23:36.480
...at least for today...

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:41.500
...I felt as if I didn't want Hikaru to be out of my arms.

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:58.560
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:02.430
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.430 --> 00:24:14.150
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.150 --> 00:24:19.920
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:28.260
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.260 --> 00:24:35.800
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.800 --> 00:24:43.440
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:51.080
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:58.620
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.620 --> 00:25:04.640
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.500 --> 00:25:15.310
We went on a ski trip,
meant to be a last moment...

00:25:15.310 --> 00:25:17.310
...in which to remember
our junior high years.

00:25:17.310 --> 00:25:21.050
But, when Kazuya plays a trick on us...

00:25:21.050 --> 00:25:24.680
...we get trapped on the lift
in the midst of a snowstorm!

00:25:24.680 --> 00:25:28.740
Next time: "One Snow-White Night! Two, Alone inside a Gondola!"
